==Battleground==
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 52 seconds<sup>1,560f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 56 seconds<sup>1,680f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 95 seconds<sup>2,850f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**1 [[Junior God Brynhildr (Enemy)|Brynhildr]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

